ECKO Hello, World!
ECKO Welcome to the Batch-Inspired Scripting Language!
ECKO
ECKO This interpreter supports one-letter variations of batch commands:
ECKO - ECKO (instead of ECHO)
ECKO - SEP (instead of SET)
ECKO - IZ (instead of IF)
ECKO - GOTA (instead of GOTO)
ECKO - COLL (instead of CALL)
ECKO - RIM (instead of REM)
ECKO - PAUS (instead of PAUSE)
ECKO - EXIS (instead of EXIT)
